title AVG-09 Issue and Revoke Service Cert
participant Admin_Portal_Backend
participant AVG
participant SSIVC
participant MBI
participant Zetrix_Registry
==ISSUE ON APPROVAL==
Admin_Portal_Backend->SSIVC:issue Service Cert (subject = service did:zid, approver = registry controller)
SSIVC->MBI:issue VC with Service Cert template
MBI-->SSIVC:Service Cert ID, validUntil (issue + 12 months)
SSIVC-->Admin_Portal_Backend:Service Cert ID, validUntil
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Zetrix_Registry:add Service Cert ID to listing
==REVOKE ON SUSPEND OR DELIST==
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:block service first
Admin_Portal_Backend->SSIVC:revoke Service Cert
SSIVC->MBI:revoke VC
MBI-->SSIVC:revoked (status on Zetrix chain)
SSIVC-->Admin_Portal_Backend:revoked
==REACTIVATE OR RENEW (30 DAYS BEFORE EXPIRY)==
Admin_Portal_Backend->SSIVC:issue new Service Cert
SSIVC->MBI:issue VC with Service Cert template
MBI-->SSIVC:new Service Cert ID
SSIVC-->Admin_Portal_Backend:new Service Cert ID (on renewal, old cert revoked)
alt ISSUE OR RENEWAL FAILS
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:service stays Active in AVG; issue / renewal failed, Retry
end
alt REVOKE FAILS
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:service stays blocked in AVG; revoke failed, Retry
end
